{"id":"35a5914b28f95584","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-equilibrium.md","title":"Market Equilibrium","display":"df-equilibrium — Market Equilibrium","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-equilibrium","aliases":["58-df-equilibrium","Market Equilibrium"],"display":"df-equilibrium — Market Equilibrium","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-equilibrium"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-equilibrium</span><span>Market Equilibrium</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-equilibrium — Market Equilibrium"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_n\\coloneqq\\mathbb R_+^n\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(P_n\\coloneqq\\mathbb R_+^n\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf d,\\mathbf s,\\mathbf z\\in V\">\\(\\mathbf d,\\mathbf s,\\mathbf z\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf d,P_n,\\mathbb R_+^n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf d,P_n,\\mathbb R_+^n)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf s,P_n,\\mathbb R_+^n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf s,P_n,\\mathbb R_+^n)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf z,P_n,\\mathbb R^n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf z,P_n,\\mathbb R^n)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MarketEq}_S(\\mathbf p;\\mathbf d,\\mathbf s,P_n)\">\\(\\mathrm{MarketEq}_S(\\mathbf p;\\mathbf d,\\mathbf s,P_n)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExcessDemand}_S(\\mathbf z;\\mathbf d,\\mathbf s,P_n)\">\\(\\mathrm{ExcessDemand}_S(\\mathbf z;\\mathbf d,\\mathbf s,P_n)\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equilibrium} \\vdash \\mathrm{MarketEq}_S(\\mathbf p;\\mathbf d,\\mathbf s,P_n)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf d,P_n,\\mathbb R_+^n)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf s,P_n,\\mathbb R_+^n)\\land\\mathbf p\\in P_n\\land\\mathbf d(\\mathbf p)=\\mathbf s(\\mathbf p)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equilibrium} \\vdash \\mathrm{MarketEq}_S(\\mathbf p;\\mathbf d,\\mathbf s,P_n)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf d,P_n,\\mathbb R_+^n)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf s,P_n,\\mathbb R_+^n)\\land\\mathbf p\\in P_n\\land\\mathbf d(\\mathbf p)=\\mathbf s(\\mathbf p)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equilibrium\\text{-}excess\\text{-}demand} \\vdash \\mathrm{ExcessDemand}_S(\\mathbf z;\\mathbf d,\\mathbf s,P_n)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf d,P_n,\\mathbb R_+^n)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf s,P_n,\\mathbb R_+^n)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf z,P_n,\\mathbb R^n)\\land\\forall\\mathbf p\\in P_n\\;(\\mathbf z(\\mathbf p)=\\mathbf d(\\mathbf p)-\\mathbf s(\\mathbf p))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equilibrium\\text{-}excess\\text{-}demand} \\vdash \\mathrm{ExcessDemand}_S(\\mathbf z;\\mathbf d,\\mathbf s,P_n)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf d,P_n,\\mathbb R_+^n)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf s,P_n,\\mathbb R_+^n)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf z,P_n,\\mathbb R^n)\\land\\forall\\mathbf p\\in P_n\\;(\\mathbf z(\\mathbf p)=\\mathbf d(\\mathbf p)-\\mathbf s(\\mathbf p))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The aggregate demand and supply schedules are explicit function parameters; the set-valued individual correspondences are not silently identified with them.</li>\n<li>Existence: under continuity, convexity of excess demand; may fail without free disposal</li>\n<li>Welfare theorems: competitive equilibrium is Pareto optimal (first theorem)</li>\n<li>Core equivalence: Edgeworth box, core converges to equilibrium as markets expand</li>\n<li>Sonnenschein-Mantel-Debreu: aggregate excess demand inherits properties from individual</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mas-Colell, Whinston and Green, Microeconomic Theory</li>\n<li>Arrow and Debreu, Existence of Competitive Equilibrium</li>\n<li>Debreu, Theory of Value</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf d,\\mathbf s,\\mathbf z\\in V$ with $\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf d,P_n,\\mathbb R_+^n)$, $\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf s,P_n,\\mathbb R_+^n)$, and $\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf z,P_n,\\mathbb R^n)$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"P_n\\coloneqq\\mathbb R_+^n\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf d,\\mathbf s,\\mathbf z\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf d,P_n,\\mathbb R_+^n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf s,P_n,\\mathbb R_+^n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf z,P_n,\\mathbb R^n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MarketEq}_S(\\mathbf p;\\mathbf d,\\mathbf s,P_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExcessDemand}_S(\\mathbf z;\\mathbf d,\\mathbf s,P_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equilibrium} \\vdash \\mathrm{MarketEq}_S(\\mathbf p;\\mathbf d,\\mathbf s,P_n)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf d,P_n,\\mathbb R_+^n)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf s,P_n,\\mathbb R_+^n)\\land\\mathbf p\\in P_n\\land\\mathbf d(\\mathbf p)=\\mathbf s(\\mathbf p)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equilibrium\\text{-}excess\\text{-}demand} \\vdash \\mathrm{ExcessDemand}_S(\\mathbf z;\\mathbf d,\\mathbf s,P_n)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf d,P_n,\\mathbb R_+^n)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf s,P_n,\\mathbb R_+^n)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf z,P_n,\\mathbb R^n)\\land\\forall\\mathbf p\\in P_n\\;(\\mathbf z(\\mathbf p)=\\mathbf d(\\mathbf p)-\\mathbf s(\\mathbf p))","display":true}],"bytes":2079,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-485","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-equilibrium.md|58-df-equilibrium]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751"]}